odder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-12T05:33:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T05:33:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"MisterPeModder","id":7838479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4Mzg0Nzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7838479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder","html_url":"https://github.com/MisterPeModder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MisterPeModder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"#### Issue Description:\n\nI was getting huge freezes while moving or sorting items in my ender chest. The whole game would freeze. Normal item moves caused it too; \"Sorted\" mod and other mods (like ClientSort) made it especially bad, but standard click and move operations also froze to a lesser extent. \n\n#### Steps to reproduce:\n\n1. Fabric 26.3 with Shulker Box Tooltip 5.4.2.\n2. Preview > Server Integration > Enabled\n3. Move items in the ender chest for a small freeze, using sorting plugin for a large freeze. \n\n#### Other Notes\n\nEnder Chest Synchronization Type was originally on Passive. Changing that to None and restarting didn’t help. Turning off Preview > Server Integration and restarting fixed it. One Sorted sort triggered 239 preview-cache saves, totaling about 9.35 seconds of client-thread blocking. ClientSort triggered 62 saves, totaling about 2.46 seconds.\n\n#### Affected Versions\n\n- ShulkerBoxTooltip: 5.4.2\n- Minecraft: 26.3\n- Fabric Loader: Latest, but has been present on many previous versions as well so somewhat irrelevant in this case\n- Fabric API: Latest, but has been present on many previous versions as well so somewhat irrelevant in this case\n- Other mods (if relevant): Any sorting mod, multiple tested and all have the same issue (even ones that do not try to do \"click move\" but instead also work with the server's move operation like ClientSort on client and server)\n\n#### Your most recent log file where the issue was present: \n\nNot logged as technically no error has occurred\n\n#### Suggestion\n\nIt looks like the preview cache gets saved synchronously on each update, with each write taking around 40 ms on my PC. Could those saves run on a worker and combine repeated updates, while keeping the preview updated immediately? I recently helped the dev of Sorted figure out a similar problem with his mod due to sqlite updates causing studders, and moving to a worker solved this issue. Perhaps this could be utilized here as well?","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/264/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/264/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/263","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/263/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/263/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/263/events","html_url":"https://github.com/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/263","id":5432204411,"node_id":"I_kwDOCjBeJM8AAAABQ8jcew","number":263,"title":"invalid dist DEDICATED_SERVER in server logs neoforge 1.21.1","user":{"login":"skadlig","id":69394508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Mzk0NTA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69394508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skadlig","html_url":"https://github.com/skadlig","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skadlig/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skadlig/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skadlig/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skadlig/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skadlig/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skadlig/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skadlig/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skadlig/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https:/