o take it out. Using either left or right click, making this configurable would be nice.\n\nCurrently with version 5.4.0, 26.2, nothing happens.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/262/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/262/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/261","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/261/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/261/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/261/events","html_url":"https://github.com/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/261","id":5361089458,"node_id":"I_kwDOCjBeJM8AAAABP4u7sg","number":261,"title":"Holding CTRL to lock tooltips should be disabled by default","user":{"login":"manwhar","id":153882497,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSwPgQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153882497?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manwhar","html_url":"https://github.com/manwhar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manwhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manwhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manwhar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manwhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manwhar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manwhar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manwhar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manwhar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manwhar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-05T21:36:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T07:55:26Z","closed_at":"2026-09-16T07:55:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In my opinion, holding L-CTRL to lock tooltips should be disabled by default.\n\nPerhaps there is a use case I am not considering, however it is very common for me to hold left control and go through a bunch of junk items in my inventory, pressing Q on each stack to discard them. Before I realized that holding L-CTRL was a setting that locks the shulker box tooltip, there were several occasions where I moused past a shulker I cared about while doing this, hit Q (thinking the cursor had traveled over the box and onto the item I was trying to reach), and moved on to let the items despawn. This, of course, does not drop the item I was targetting, but instead the shulker I had momentarily grazed with my cursor. Only later did I realize that the shulker box was no longer in my inventory, and by then it had despawned.\n\nI can't think of what the \"locking\" use case is, so let me know! I think the key should either be disabled by default, or else switched away from L-CTRL to ensure new users don't accidentally have the same thing happen.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/261/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/261/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"sco