ected Versions (Do *not* use \"latest\"):\n\n- ShulkerBoxTooltip: 5.3.0+26.1.1-fabric (probably all)\n- Minecraft: 26.1.2 (probably all)\n- Fabric Loader: 0.19.3 (probably all)\n- Fabric API: 0.155.2+26.1.2 (probably all)\n- Other mods (if relevant): not relevant\n\n#### Your most recent log file where the issue was present: \n\n[pastebin/gist/etc link here] you do not need this. this bug is a logical oversight.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/259/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/259/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/258","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/258/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/258/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/258/events","html_url":"https://github.com/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/258","id":5081044893,"node_id":"I_kwDOCjBeJM8AAAABLtqXnQ","number":258,"title":"Modrinth version mismatch","user":{"login":"slin-o","id":140956517,"node_id":"U_kgDOCGbTZQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140956517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/slin-o","html_url":"https://github.com/slin-o","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slin-o/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slin-o/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slin-o/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slin-o/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com