ce:\n\n1. Apply a bunch of effects (3 to 6 is enough) to yourself for a long enough duration\n2. Put a filled shulker box in one of the 4 most right slots in your inventory\n3. Hover over the shulker box and hold `Left alt`+`Left ctrl` down\n4. Hover over an item that is over an effect box\n5. Both the item's tooltip and the effect's tooltip will display\n\n#### Image:\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d14a464f-3cf2-4a61-8b66-a1093ce30f6d\" />\n\n____\n#### Affected Versions:\n\n- ShulkerBoxTooltip: 5.4.0+26.2-fabric (as far as I tested, older versions might be affected too)\n- Minecraft: 26.2\n- Fabric Loader: 0.19.3\n- Fabric API: 0.156.0+26.2\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/257/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/issues/257/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}